            <pb n="1a"/><lb n="1a1"/> <rs type="place" ana="corpusmd:named_reference" ref="db:5558">rgya gar</rs> skad du | <rs type="work" ana="corpusmd:named_reference" ref="db:5515"><rs type="work" ref="db:3775">saM ban d+ha pa ri k+Sha</rs> a laM ka ra puSH+pa</rs> nA ma ¦ <rs type="place" ana="corpusmd:named_reference" ref="db:5559">bod</rs> skad du | <rs type="work" ana="corpusmd:named_reference" ref="db:5515"><rs type="work" ana="corpusmd:named_reference" ref="3775">'brel ba brtag pa</rs> rgyan gyi me tog</rs> ces bya ba |</seg>
